# Keep the build context to source only: no secrets, local state, or host-built artifacts.
# Patterns are anchored at the context root, so nested files need `**/`.
.git
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/.secrets

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/out
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# The custodian's host virtualenv (macOS binaries) and Python caches; the image builds its own.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.DS_Store

.agents
.claude
.playwright
.playwright-cli
**/.dev
